# Hygiene codename list for scripts/cohesion-check.sh.
#
# Copy this file to ".hygiene-names" (which is gitignored) and fill in the real
# internal consumer names / codenames the hygiene gate should catch. One name
# per line; blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored. Alternatively,
# set HYGIENE_NAMES to a pipe-separated list.
#
# These names must NEVER be committed to this public repo — keeping them out of
# version control is the entire point of the gate.
#
# example-codename
# another-internal-name
